  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-30-62">あらめの衣身にまとひ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-62-94">城より城をへめぐりつ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-94-123">上慢四衆の人ごとに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-123-157">菩薩は礼をなしたまふ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-157-195">（われは不軽ぞかれは慢</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-195-236">こは無明なりしかもあれ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-236-271">いましも展く法性と</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-271-311">菩薩は礼をなし給ふ）</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-311-337">われ汝等を尊敬す</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-337-366">敢て軽賤なさざるは</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-366-392">汝等作仏せん故と</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-392-423">菩薩は礼をなし給ふ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-423-467">（こゝにわれなくかれもなし</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-467-499">たゞ一乗の法界ぞ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-499-534">法界をこそ拝すれと</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-534-570">菩薩は礼をなし給ふ）</seg></p>
    </body>
